        <dc:description>&lt;p&gt;Saraynea does not know why she is being hunted by a clan or why corrupted spirits are showing up outside the spirit realm. As a shaman, she has a strong connection to the elemental spirits and wants to find out who or what is trying to hurt them. As she flees from the clan, she meets six friends that forms a powerful team to try to help her on her quest, but when they discover what the clan leader is planning and why Saraynea is such an important component to his plans, they’ll need to combine their skills to save her and the spirits.&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
